+//     size, 0.6 to 1.8 (the editor's slider), 1 is the game's own size.
+//   +0x230: u32 manual mask (bit i: element i has a manual setting).
+//   +0x234: u32 hidden mask (bit i: element i is hidden).
+// The state page starts zeroed, so an unwritten block reads as no manual
+// setting and nothing hidden, and a zero / non-number k reads as 1.
+// A manual setting is per element and independent: moving the coins does not
+// move the moons, and hiding one element leaves the others alone.
 //
